@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Role-Aware Bulk Upload with Immutable Versions
actor User
participant UI
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Upload Service" as Upload
participant Scanner
participant Classifier
participant "Duplicate Detector" as Dup
participant "Version Service" as Version
participant Indexer
participant Audit
User -> UI : Select Bulk upload
UI -> Auth : permission + tenant + scope
Auth --> UI : allowed scope
UI -> Upload : create batch and upload/resume
Upload -> Scanner : scan items
Scanner --> Upload : safe/quarantined
Upload -> Classifier : extract/classify safe items
Classifier --> Upload : metadata suggestions
Upload -> Dup : checksum/similarity check
Dup --> Upload : exact/probable matches
Upload --> UI : confirmation when needed
User -> UI : version/link/new item/cancel
UI -> Upload : decisions
Upload -> Version : append immutable versions
Version --> Upload : IDs
Upload -> Indexer : indexing events
Upload -> Audit : actor, role, batch, versions, errors
Upload --> UI : partial/success report
@enduml
